        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@“%@”将从登录项中移除，此操作不会删除应用文件。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ “%@” will be removed from Login Items. App files will not be deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@“%@”将移入废纸篓，重新登录后相关功能将不再加载。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ “%@” will be moved to Trash. Its features will no longer load after you sign in again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@“%@”的启动配置将移入废纸篓；已运行的进程不会被强制终止。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ “%@”'s launch configuration will be moved to Trash. Running processes will not be terminated."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（PID %d）正在占用 %@ %@:%@。正常结束更安全；只有进程无响应时才使用强制结束。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ (PID %d) is using %@ %@:%@. Graceful quit is safer; use force quit only if the process is unresponsive."
          }
        }
      }
    },
