    "Xcode 构建产物，可重新生成，但下次构建会变慢。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Xcode build products can be regenerated, but the next build will be slower."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 会主动利用空闲内存作为文件缓存，这些缓存会在应用需要时自动释放。强制“释放内存”通常会清空有用缓存，反而让系统变慢。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS uses free memory as a file cache and releases it automatically when apps need it. Forcing memory to be freed usually discards useful caches and can make the system slower."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 系统管理的进程不会在这里结束。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Processes managed by macOS cannot be quit here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 自带，受系统保护" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Built into macOS and system protected"
