    },
    "这会重置全部登录项和后台活动记录，不只清理当前残留。仍然安装的 App 之后会重新登记，部分允许或禁止状态可能需要重新确认。完成后需要重启 Mac。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This resets all login item and background activity records, not just the current leftover. Installed apps will register again, and some allowed or blocked states may need confirmation. Restart your Mac afterward."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这只会丢弃 macOS 可重建的文件缓存，不会释放 App 私有内存。操作需要管理员授权，而且可能让随后打开的 App 暂时变慢。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This only discards file caches that macOS can rebuild; it does not release private app memory. Administrator authorization is required, and apps may open more slowly for a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这需要管理员授权。系统会丢弃可重建的文件缓存，不会释放 App 私有内存；随后重新打开 App 可能暂时变慢。" : {
